        "name": "kache"
      },
      "full_text": "I took a conference talk from Dennis (@voxagonlabs), transcribed it, told fable to make the same tools that he spoke about, and then we drove down the time per frame aggressively.\n\nBig credits to both Dennis & Erin for teaching how this stuff works. 80% of the perf ideas were fable porting what Erin did.\n\nI corrected fable's wrongs a lot of the time, but not because I knew it was wrong -- instead, I was skeptical and told it to check using profiling tools\n\nMusic in the video is from Cynthoni's newest album, check it out on bandcamp",
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": [
        "voxagonlabs"
      ],
